 *
 * @code
 * process:
 *   destination_field:
 *     plugin: callback
 *     callable:
 *       - '\Drupal\Component\Utility\Unicode'
 *       - ucfirst
 *     source: source_field
 * @endcode
 *
 * An example where the callback accepts no arguments:
 *
 * @code
 * process:
 *   time:
 *     plugin: callback
 *     callable: time
 *     unpack_source: true
 *     source: [  ]
 * @endcode
 *
 * An example where the callback accepts more than one argument:
 *
 * @code
 * source:
 *   plugin: source_plugin_goes_here
 *   constants:
 *     slash: /
